:"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot stable 4.6.3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13450HX   2.40 GHz\n\nNVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 6GB Laptop GPU (6 GB), Intel(R) UHD Graphics (128 MB)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSince third-party plugins typically load audio files directly without going through Godot's resource loader, Godot's export process does not automatically include these assets in the final build.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse third-party audio engines, here used FMOD (https://github.com/PigeonLab-Dev/godot-fmodplayer)\n\nLoad the audio from the FMOD and don't load it by Godot\n\n```gdscript\nvar channel: FmodChannel\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar sound: FmodSound = FmodSound.load_from_file(\"res://music.mp3\")\n\tchannel = FmodServer.get_main_system().play_sound(sound, FmodServer.get_master_channel_group())\n```\n\nRun project, audio can be played.\n\nExport the project, and set all the files can be export.\n\nIn exported project, audio can't be played.\n\nProject needs submit latter","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThou